# Removes core.ui's Swing context-menu warm-up from the @OnShowing runnables (Modules/UIReady).
# Without core.windows, WindowManager.invokeWhenUIReady runs them on the AWT thread as soon as the
# modules load, and this one creates an AbstractNode there while the start-up thread may be
# initializing DataObject -> Node (Node.EMPTY = new AbstractNode(...)): each thread then waits for
# the other's class initialization and the application never comes up. The warm-up only primes
# Swing popup menus the JavaFX shell does not use.
#-org.netbeans.core.ui.warmup.ContextMenuWarmUpTask
